                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x}{8\\sqrt{36+x^2}}-\\frac{1}{10}&=0\\\\10x&=8\\sqrt{36+x^2}\\\\100x^2&=64(36+x^2)\\\\100x^2-64x^2&=64\\times36\\\\36x^2-64\\times36&=0\\\\36(x^2-64)&=0\\\\x&=8\\qquad(0\\le x\\le20).\\end{aligned}",
